"Change the color saturation using the HSL color model.\n"
"-1.0 more grayish\n"
" 0.0 disable\n"
" 1.0 more saturated"
msgstr ""
"Klöörsattheit mit dat TSH-Klöörmodell ännern.\n"
"-1.0 - keesiger\n"
" 0.0 - ut\n"
" 1.0 - satter"

